<title>USA: Stephan says has no reason for price drop.</title>
<headline>Stephan says has no reason for price drop.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stephan Co said Friday it is unaware of any reason for the recent decline in the price of its stock.</p>
<p>In trading Thursday, the company's stock hit a low of 10-1/2 and closed at 10-3/4, down 3/4 on the day.</p>
<p>As of Friday morning, the stock was up 7/8 to 11-5/8.</p>
</text>
